The 354-symbol benchmark (`data/gold_symbols.jsonl`) is derived from the
reference patches distributed with SWE-bench Lite (MIT licensed by its
authors), and inherits that licence. The repository snapshots themselves are
not redistributed here; `tools/fetch_repos.py` refetches them from GitHub at
the exact base commits.
